      "writtenOn": "2022-06-22T12:19:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ConnectivityManager#setFirewallChainEnabled API calls BpfNetMaps#setChildChain.\nBefore this CL, if pre-T devices call setFirewallChainEnabled, they got ServiceSpecificException wrapped by IllegalStateException.\nSo, I throw ServiceSpecificException to keep this behavior.\n\nBut I realized when we did not have T, we did not have ConnectivityManager#setFirewallChainEnabled API and javadoc did not say this API throws IllegalStateException.\nSo, It seems fine to throw UnsupportedOperationException.\n\nI have updated.",
